egin="01:03.470" end="01:03.650">the </span><span begin="01:03.650" end="01:04.010">apes </span><span begin="01:04.010" end="01:04.490">climbed </span><span begin="01:04.490" end="01:04.760">down </span><span begin="01:04.760" end="01:05.000">from </span><span begin="01:05.000" end="01:05.120">the </span><span begin="01:05.120" end="01:06.350">trees</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.560" end="01:09.860"><span begin="01:06.560" end="01:06.740">And </span><span begin="01:06.740" end="01:07.040">grew </span><span begin="01:07.040" end="01:07.610">tall </span><span begin="01:07.610" end="01:07.850">and </span><span begin="01:07.850" end="01:07.970">they </span><span begin="01:07.970" end="01:08.720">started </span><span begin="01:08.720" end="01:09.860">talking</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.250" end="01:13.430"><span begin="01:10.250" end="01:10.520">And </span><span begin="01:10.520" end="01:10.580">the </span><span begin="01:10.580" end="01:11.090">stars </span><span begin="01:11.090" end="01:11.600">fell </span><span begin="01:11.600" end="01:11.930">out </span><span begin="01:11.930" end="01:12.050">of </span><span begin="01:12.050" end="01:12.140">the </span><span begin="01:12.140" end="01:13.430">sky</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.730" end="01:16.880"><span begin="01:13.730" end="01:14.060">And </span><span begin="01:14.060" end="01:14.150">my </span><span begin="01:14.150" end="01:14.660">tears </span><span begin="01:14.660" end="01:15.170">rolled </span><span begin="01:15.170" end="01:15.560">into </span><span begin="01:15.560" end="01:15.770">the </span><span begin="01:15.770" end="01:16.880">ocean</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.150" end="01:20.420"><span begin="01:17.150" end="01:17.300">And </span><span begin="01:17.300" end="01:17.540">now </span><span begin="01:17.540" end="01:17.570">I</span><span begin="01:17.570" end="01:17.600">’</span><span begin="01:17.600" end="01:17.690">m </span><span begin="01:17.690" end="01: